sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(232, 240, 254) Ingest
        participant API
        participant Queue@{ "type": "queue" }
    end
    box transparent Workers
        participant Thumbnailer
        participant Indexer
    end
    participant Bucket@{ "type": "database" } as Object store

    API-)Queue: publish(upload.created)
    par thumbnail
        Queue-)Thumbnailer: upload.created
        Thumbnailer->>Bucket: PUT /thumbs/{id}.webp
    and index
        Queue-)Indexer: upload.created
        Indexer->>Bucket: HEAD /uploads/{id}
    end
    Note over Thumbnailer,Indexer: Both consumers ack independently
    Thumbnailer--)Queue: ack
    Indexer--)Queue: ack
